# Copy to .env.local. Read by `npm run build`, `start`, `deploy` and
# `verify:supabase` - it points at the PRODUCTION Supabase project.
# For the local stack use .env.development.local (dev mode only); never create
# .env.production.local. See docs/local-environment-runbook.md.

# Required. Public values, compiled into the browser bundle.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# Optional, local only. Never in the bundle, Wrangler vars, docs or chat.
# Calls the `embed` Edge Function (supabase/functions/embed).
# BOKS_EMBED_KEY=
# ElevenLabs, for generating narration and themes (docs/media-generation.md).
# ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
# Resend SMTP password, resolved by `supabase config push` from the shell
# (supabase/config.toml). Export it in the shell rather than storing it here.
# RESEND_API_KEY=
